WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Solitaire

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.920
Where are the crystals?

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.910
Right here!

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.840
I've got all five of them!

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.030
Regina!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.470
This is...

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.110
What?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.360
The crystals...

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.020
Flew away...

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.310
Hey! What gives?!

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.460
How the heck should <i>we</i> know?!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:42.970
Geez!

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.890
We're going after them!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.630
Let's go too!

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.790
Wait!

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.820
Where would we go?

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:06.110
You all seem to be at a loss.

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:09.020
Please leave this matter to me.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:10.980
Mr. Sebastian?

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:18.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:29.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:36.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:47.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:52.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:58.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:07.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.370
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.170
What's more than just cute

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:27.090
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:32.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.010
Guided By The Crystals!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.010
Guided By The Crystals!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:55.030
The crystals are currently heading northeast. {Cool, let's go find the Dragon Balls after this.}

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.660
They are traveling at Mach 3.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.850
Wow!

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:01.050
How do you know all that?

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:05.370
Satellite data can deliver very precise locations.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.220
Well, that's honest...

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.340
What kind of guy <i>is</i> Sebastian?

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:12.840
A butler for the Yotsuba family!

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:17.180
The signal has stopped responding.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.820
What could that mean?

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.620
Does that mean we've lost track of the crystals?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.160
Indeed.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.660
Oh no...

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.000
Let's go to where the signal disappeared!

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.700
Its coordinates appear to be in a glacial region.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.090
Glacial region?

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.210
What kind of place is that?

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:40.670
A place covered in ice that stays frozen year-round.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.500
Sounds breezy!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:47.130
I wouldn't say "breezy" when it's a dangerously frigid mountain of ice.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.550
How do we get there?

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:52.890
Everyone,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.990
leave this matter to me as well.

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.050
Sebastian's really something!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.360
He's as resourceful as Batman! {She literally says Superman. It probably isn't a direct reference to the superhero, but it's too fitting to pass up, and they're both DC characters anyway.}

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.770
Makoto, is something the matter?

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:16.470
We have to reach the crystals before Regina's team does at all costs!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.250
Indeed we do.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.380
Either way, we can't just let her off!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.320
She broke her promise with Mana!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.240
Yeah!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.950
But Regina was acting kind of strange back then...

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.480
<i>Give them the crystal?</i>

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.960
<i>Regina?</i>

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:36.860
<i>No...</i>

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.120
<i>No...</i>

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.460
<i>I want the crystals...</i>

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.160
Her eyes looked different...

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.860
That could just be her true nature.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:51.550
I know you want to trust her.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:55.290
But the fact is that she betrayed you.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:59.390
She may not wish to settle things with another game next time.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:00.680
Yeah...

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:16.330
The crystals disappeared around the peak of that mountain.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.400
It is dangerous to go any further by helicopter.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.210
So we have to climb the mountain ourselves?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.140
Indeed.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.230
You all aren't headed for the summit, are ya?

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:26.810
We are.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.580
Don't do it.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.970
That mountain's a sacred one,

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.290
and nobody can intrude near the summit.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.980
Even now, not one person has made it to the top.

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.990
Really?

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.680
Worry not.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.660
The given coordinates are outside the restricted area.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:50.270
Even then, that mountain ain't something little girls can handle.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.870
Don't go courtin' danger.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.090
But we still have to go!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.580
I know we'll find what we've been searching for there!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.680
Guess y'all have your reasons...

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:01.660
We do.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:06.120
Then you better believe in the legend of the mountain's light.

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.450
Legend of its light?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.930
Legend has it that long ago, on this very mountain,

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:19.250
a group of close friends - a <i>team</i> - was saved by a miraculous light.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.260
I'll be prayin' for ya.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.560
Thank you!

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.120
Okay, let's go!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.060
Believe in the legendary light!

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.980
Have a safe trip.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.890
Charles!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.820
Precure Love Link!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.550
L-O-V-E!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:49.260
L-O-V-E!

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.030
L-O-V-E!

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.130
L-O-V-E!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:17.520
Brimming with love,

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.740
Cure Heart!

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:23.910
The light of wisdom,

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.220
Cure Diamond!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.130
The warmth of the sun,

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.540
Cure Rosetta!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:35.640
The blade of courage,

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.700
Cure Sword!

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.900
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.140
Dokidoki Precure!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.530
The light...

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.330
Restricted area my foot!

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:59.000
I'm going to be the first man to reach the peak!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.540
You doing all right?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.640
You seem to be out of breath.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:14.290
This is... nothing!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.410
Besides... I'm still...

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.120
A Trump Kingdom... knight!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:24.180
You're making us doubt the strength of Trump Kingdom's knights.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.590
You gotta know your limits!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.580
I-I'm fine!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.570
I can always jump in and save the day when it's truly needed!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.730
The air's gotten thinner.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.940
It's pretty cold, too.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.190
But we can endure it while transformed.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.240
Where did the crystals disappear?

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:54.460
According to the coordinates, it should be around here,

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.850
but they're nowhere in sight.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.120
Maybe they're buried under the snow?

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.910
All right, let's dig!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.300
What, the whole thing?

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.000
I don't think...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.970
that'll get you... anywhere...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.510
Where are you, crystals?

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:16.930
If that legendary light is real, then please shine!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.900
There you are, Precures!

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.380
Regina!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.320
We heard your little chat.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.270
So, the crystals are around here?

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.370
We'll gladly take them, then.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.830
Thanks for searching.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.250
How underhanded can you get?

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.530
Should you not say something to Cure Heart?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.500
Oh, I will.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.300
I won't give up the crystals.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.970
Regina...

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.930
What do you plan to do with the crystals?

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.540
That's none of your business, isn't it?

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:55.530
Yes it is!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:10:01.150
Those crystals could be the key to saving Trump Kingdom... and the world!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:05.440
I won't let you have the princess or the crystals!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.750
Hmph! Who cares about some dumb princess?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.160
I only want the crystals.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.150
The crystals!

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:16.320
Regina, what's wrong with you?

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.130
You're not the Regina I knew!

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:22.370
Hmph. What did you ever know about me?

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.590
Regina! {I await the day in which Regina confrontations will stop consisting of Heart repeating Regina's name repeatedly.}

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:26.850
There's no point in talking any more, Cure Heart.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.110
That girl is...

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.580
no longer your friend! {DUN-DUN-DUN}

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.420
Go away!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.390
The crystals are mine!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.850
Love Heart Arrow!

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:51.380
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.750
Just get out of my sight!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.660
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:22.440
Regina! {That day has yet to come.}

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.070
Cure Heart!

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.160
Mana!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.300
Mana!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.770
This is all my fault...

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.690
It's not.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.590
Mana chose to help Regina on her own.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.010
Indeed she did.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:10.120
Mana still thinks of Regina as a friend.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.830
Either way, we have to save her.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.690
Ladies, why not put aside our quarrel for today?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.240
Put aside?

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.890
You're just going to attack us after lowering our guard!

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:25.840
You can think what you want,

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.600
but don't you have a friend you ought to search for?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:35.570
Well, you three will be in trouble if anything happens to King Selfish's daughter.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:39.880
Personally, I wouldn't mind if something happened to that girl.

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:44.800
Nah, I don't want my head on King Selfish's chopping block 'cause of her.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.480
I don't think this is the time to squabble.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:48.560
True.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.930
Let's focus on finding Cure Heart.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.160
Now, let's go too.

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.950
It's a rather deep crevice...

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:02.010
Let's all be careful.

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:05.600
Please be safe, Cure Heart...

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:10.380
Cold!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:16.660
Mana...

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:18.740
What?

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.690
The crystals?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.520
Pretty...

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:48.910
Regina, look out!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.060
Mana, look!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:12.520
The princess...

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:15.270
It's her?

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.480
The crystals must have led us to her!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.400
She's beautiful...

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.210
Yeah...

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:25.940
Mana...

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.050
Here.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.960
I'm sorry for breaking our promise.

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:40.930
You're back...

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.570
You're back to the Regina I know!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.040
Wait, Mana!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.830
It's really you!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.360
Of course it is!

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:54.580
You're a weirdo!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.480
But what am I "back" from?

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.230
I don't know.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.950
But up until now, you were like a different person.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:07.230
And when you looked at the crystals, your eyes just... changed.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:10.890
What about now?

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.120
They're not changing.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.590
I wonder what came over you?

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:20.460
But if this is really the princess, we have to tell Makopi right away!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.460
Makopi's been searching for her this whole time.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.500
What for?

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.470
Well...

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:33.250
she wants to restore her ruined Trump Kingdom and save its people.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:37.530
What would happen to Daddy if she did?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.840
That woman turned Daddy to stone...

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.290
Hey, Regina...

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.640
I don't know what could happen either,

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:49.840
but if your dad turns Trump Kingdom back to normal,

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.430
the princess wouldn't have anything to fight over, right?

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.240
They can understand each other!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:00.590
You and I are friends, after all!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:03.340
But Daddy's really scary...

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.970
It'll be fine!

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:08.580
We can help the princess and your dad see eye to eye.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:10.700
Yeah...

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.470
Girls! {Nobody cares about Joe.}

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.330
Charles!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:23.280
I lost track of Mana!

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:26.550
Don't worry, Mana must be nearby.

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.170
Let us search together!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.370
But there's one problem...

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.420
There aren't any more footholds.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.740
I can handle that!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:43.650
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:55.340
That light was from the Diamond Shower!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:59.280
They all must have come for us!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.490
Hey!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.520
Girls!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.290
Geez!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:06.070
You don't need to shout for me to take you along.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:09.530
Huh?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.190
Huh?!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.390
Why?

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.700
I can't use my power...

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.690
Mana!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.140
Girls!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.340
Regina, everyone <i>did</i> come!

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.320
So, if you go...

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:31.040
It'd be weird if I went with you...

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:34.510
I broke our promise and was mean to everyone... {alt. "I was a cunt to everyone." This is a far more accurate translation.}

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.030
Then let's apologize.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:42.390
I'll apologize with you however many times it takes for them to forgive you!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.580
But why you?

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.360
Because we're all friends!

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:46.780
You and everyone else!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:48.650
So,

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:53.560
until everyone understands you, we'll apologize together!

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:55.700
That's dumb!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:56.930
Huh?

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:03.680
I've never met anyone as dumb as you!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.910
But I'm even dumber for betraying you!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.330
Dumb, dumb, dumb, dumb!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.750
Regina...

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.090
Mana!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.330
Charles!

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.180
Mana!

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.650
Girls!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.680
Thank goodness you two are safe!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:29.880
Honestly, I can't let myself trust you.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.630
But Mana would be sad if you weren't around...

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:40.170
Thanks! I knew for a fact you'd all come!

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:43.540
And then I saw the light from that Diamond Shower...

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.230
The legend of the miraculous light truly did happen!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.560
And that's not the only miracle!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.080
Ann!

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:55.970
Princess!

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:58.160
It really is the princess!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.410
We found her!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.500
Indeed!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.260
Princess!

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:01.720
Ann!

